#### Numerical Integration
**Mid-ordinate rule:**
`∫ₐᵇ y dx ≈ h(y₁/₂ + y₃/₂ + ... + y_(n−1/2))`  where `h = (b − a)/n`
**Simpson's rule:**
`∫ₐᵇ y dx ≈ (h/3)[y₀ + 4(y₁ + y₃ + ...) + 2(y₂ + y₄ + ...) + yₙ]`  where `h = (b − a)/n`, n even
#### Numerical Solution of Differential Equations
**Euler's method:**
`y_(r+1) = y_r + h·f(x_r, y_r)`,  `x_(r+1) = x_r + h`
**Improved Euler method:**
`y_(r+1) = y_(r−1) + 2h·f(x_r, y_r)`,  `x_(r+1) = x_r + h`
